e-bg'>			<span class='event-month'>Nov</span>			<span class='event-day'>18</span>		</div>	</div>	<div class='event-text'>	<div class='event-item-header'><h3><a class='event-title' href="https://stlcc.edu/events#event-details/613fbc7f-207d-4954-b50e-9cee60ed7362">Lunch and Learn: Impaired Driving Awareness Workshop</a></h3>		</div>	<div class="event-item-copy"><p><p>Join STLCC Campus Life and Campus Police for an informative workshop about the dangers of...</p>		</div>		<div class='event-item-time-location'>			<span class='time'>11:00 AM</span>		</div>		</div>		</div></div>
