               <div class="pathways-to-success-home">
                  
                  <div class="pathways-container">
                     
                     <div class="content-block-video">
                        
                        <div class="content-block-video-text">
                           
                           <h2 class="default-headline">PATHWAYS TO SUCCESS</h2>
                           
                           <h2><strong>FOLLOW YOUR PATH</strong></h2>
                           
                           <div class="pathways-to-success-home-spacer">&nbsp;</div>
                           
                           <p>&nbsp;</p>
                           
                           <p>STLCC meets you where you are with programs that make sense for your life. Transfer
                              to a four-year university, earn a certificate to advance your career or complete focused
                              training for immediate employment. Our focused pathways help you achieve your goals,
                              saving both time and money in the process.</p>
                           
                           <p><a id="blue-button-snippet" class="blue-button-snippet-inverse-home" href="/pathways/index.aspx">Explore Programs</a></p>
                           </div>
                        
                        <div class="content-block-video-iframe"><iframe class="pathways-video" title="Pathways to Success video" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/9rSIR80nQXg?si=lJiaejxLew95nQCk&amp;controls=0" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe></div>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
               
               <div class="pathways-home-page-cta">
                  
                  <div class="pathways-home-page-cta-logo"><picture>
                        <source srcset="/images/logos-icons/archie-fox-mascot-paper-plane.jpg, /images/logos-icons/archie-fox-mascot-paper-plane-2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width: 699px)"></source>
                        <source srcset="/images/logos-icons/archie-fox-mascot-paper-plane-2x.jpg, /images/logos-icons/archie-fox-mascot-paper-plane-2x.jpg 2x"></source><img src="/images/logos-icons/archie-fox-mascot-paper-plane.jpg" width="600" height="600" alt="Archie Fox Mascot Logo" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='https://cms.stlcc.edu/files/content?site=Pub_website&amp;path=/images/logos-icons/archie-fox-mascot-logo.png'"></picture></div>
                  
                  <div class="pathways-home-page-cta-text">
                     
                     <h2><strong>MEET STLCC</strong></h2>
                     
                     <p><strong>Through economic shifts and rising higher education costs, STLCC has remained a steadfast
                           source of opportunity. That's our promise to you.</strong></p>
                     
                     <p>STLCC has served over 1.3 million students, representing more than 50% of St. Louis
                        area households in our student body. Since 1962, we've believed in the transformative
                        power of education—lifting individuals, communities and our city. This belief inspires
                        us to continue providing opportunities and hope for a better future.</p>
                     
                     <p>STLCC offers affordable education. Our tuition and fees are 75% less than Missouri's
                        largest public four-year university, saving more than $11,000 annually. Over the lifetime
                        of your career, you can earn $2 million with an associate degree and $2.8 million
                        with a bachelor's degree. Compare this to only $1.6 million with a high school diploma.</p>
                     
                     <p>STLCC is proud to help more students transfer to four-year Missouri public universities
                        than any other community college in the state. Research shows that students who earn
                        associate degrees before transferring perform better academically, have higher grade
                        point averages and are more likely to earn their bachelor's degree than students who
                        do not complete an associate degree. We provide the tools for your success, ensuring
                        you a confident future.</p>
                     
                     <p>We offer stackable credentials for career advancement and hundreds of online courses.
                        With a 22:1 student-teacher ratio and various learning modalities, STLCC provides
                        personalized education.</p>
                     
                     <p>Since 1966, STLCC has been accredited by the Higher Learning Commission, a testament
                        to our commitment to high standards in education, services and faculty. This accreditation
                        ensures that you receive a quality education recognized and respected in the academic
                        and professional world.</p>
                     
                     <p><a id="blue-button-snippet" class="blue-button-snippet-dark" href="/about/index.aspx">Learn More About STLCC</a></p>
                     </div>
                  </div>
            </div>
